Client: React
Server: ModeJS-Express-PostGreSQL-Opensearch


////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


Running app:
1: cd to server/
2: node server.js
3: In new tab, cd to client/ 
4: npm run start


////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


Server App available at: 
http://localhost:8080/ => displays React component 
http://localhost:8080/users, http://localhost:8080/users/1 etc => Connects with PostgreSQL 

sample body for POST/PUT in http://localhost:8080/users/1 
{
  "name": "Shawn Doe",
  "email": "shawnn@exartemple.com",
  "password": "hashed-password",
  "role": "candidate",
  "status": 0
}

header: Content-Type: application/json


////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


Client App available at:
http://localhost:3000/


////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


Opensearch dashboard locally hosted: http://localhost:5601/
OpenSearch Performance Analyzer at: http://localhost:9200/

Steps: 
1: docker pull opensearchproject/opensearch:3.1.0
2: docker pull opensearchproject/opensearch-dashboards:3.1.0
3: docker network create my-opensearch-network

4: docker run -d \
  -p 9200:9200 -p 9600:9600 \
  -e "discovery.type=single-node" \
  -e "OPENSEARCH_JAVA_OPTS=-Xms512m -Xmx512m" \
  -e "plugins.security.disabled=true" \
  -e "DISABLE_INSTALL_DEMO_CONFIG=true" \
  --name my-opensearch-node \
  --network my-opensearch-network \
  opensearchproject/opensearch:3.1.0

 5: Check if running: curl -X GET "http://localhost:9200/" 

  Results should be: 
          priyanka@Priyankas-MacBook-Pro opensearch % curl -X GET "http://localhost:9200/"
          {
            "name" : "57f3df731864",
            "cluster_name" : "docker-cluster",
            "cluster_uuid" : "l3gjnaIFS0eo0k-SnV7o5g",
            "version" : {
              "distribution" : "opensearch",
              "number" : "3.1.0",
              "build_type" : "tar",
              "build_hash" : "8ff7c6ee924a49f0f59f80a6e1c73073c8904214",
              "build_date" : "2025-06-21T08:05:50.445588571Z",
              "build_snapshot" : false,
              "lucene_version" : "10.2.1",
              "minimum_wire_compatibility_version" : "2.19.0",
              "minimum_index_compatibility_version" : "2.0.0"
            },
            "tagline" : "The OpenSearch Project: https://opensearch.org/"
          }

6: run the dashboard:           

docker run -d \
  -p 5601:5601 \
  -e "OPENSEARCH_HOSTS=[\"http://my-opensearch-node:9200\"]" \
  -e "DISABLE_SECURITY_DASHBOARDS_PLUGIN=true" \
  --name my-opensearch-dashboards \
  --network my-opensearch-network \
  opensearchproject/opensearch-dashboards:3.1.0

  7: Check if running: http://localhost:5601/

REF: https://oofnivek.medium.com/macos-running-opensearch-f0ccf3d55af7

